WEBVTT

00:01.960 --> 00:07.000
<b>One, eyes drawn to the other side.</b>

00:07.580 --> 00:12.540
<b>Two, the homeland suddenly a long way off.</b>

00:12.920 --> 00:17.790
<b>Three, parents whose faces cannot be seen.</b>

00:18.420 --> 00:23.460
<b>Four, trace the path to the underworld.</b>

00:25.000 --> 00:30.040
<b>Five, they grow farther away over time.</b>

00:30.580 --> 00:35.580
<b>Six, nostalgic for the olden days.</b>

00:36.000 --> 00:40.500
<b>Seven, all the tears dry to nothing.</b>

00:41.500 --> 00:44.170
<b>Eight, and before long...</b>

00:49.710 --> 00:51.170
<b>That's where the song ends.</b>

02:22.500 --> 02:24.500
<b>KAEI YEAR 6 (1853)</b>

02:44.130 --> 02:45.250
<b>E-excuse me!</b>

02:52.080 --> 02:54.750
<b>I'm so sorry, sir! Please forgive my rudeness!</b>

02:54.960 --> 02:57.460
<b>No, I'm the one who should've been watching my step.</b>

02:58.250 --> 02:59.920
<b>Allow me to apologize.</b>

03:00.250 --> 03:01.790
<b>Oh, b-but I...</b>

03:01.790 --> 03:03.830
<b>No need to fret, little lady.</b>

03:04.130 --> 03:06.920
<b>This fella here is Naotsugu Miura-sama,</b>

03:06.920 --> 03:10.790
<b>and while he may be a samurai, he's famous
around these parts for having a heart of gold.</b>

03:15.290 --> 03:18.130
<b>Thanks for waiting. Here's your kake-soba.</b>

03:18.460 --> 03:19.670
<b>Thank you kindly.</b>

03:23.960 --> 03:26.330
<b>What's the matter, Naotsugu-sama?</b>

03:26.330 --> 03:28.500
<b>No appetite today or what?</b>

03:28.500 --> 03:32.630
<b>Oh, not exactly. Just a nagging concern, I suppose.</b>

03:32.630 --> 03:34.630
<b>Got something on your mind?</b>

03:35.130 --> 03:35.830
<b>Yes.</b>

03:39.170 --> 03:42.080
<b>Would you lend me an ear, good sir?</b>

03:42.330 --> 03:45.290
<b>Sure. I'll listen to whatever you need to get off your chest.</b>

03:45.290 --> 03:46.210
<b>Thank you.</b>

03:47.290 --> 03:50.210
<b>It's about my older brother, you see...</b>

03:50.210 --> 03:52.630
<b>Whoa, hold your horses!</b>

03:52.630 --> 03:54.380
<b>Don't start talking crazy.</b>

03:54.380 --> 03:59.000
<b>Everybody knows that you're the Miura family heir.
There's no way you have an older brother.</b>

03:59.330 --> 04:02.420
<b>No, I am quite certain that I had an older brother!</b>

04:02.750 --> 04:03.630
<b>Ofuu-san?</b>

04:03.750 --> 04:05.080
<b>Y-yes?</b>

04:05.290 --> 04:09.670
<b>Do you know him? Perhaps you've heard of a man
by the name Sadanaga Miura?</b>

04:11.040 --> 04:12.630
<b>I'm afraid not.</b>

04:14.580 --> 04:18.500
<b>Well, that figures.
Nobody seems to know about my brother.</b>

04:19.250 --> 04:20.830
<b>Not even my parents.</b>

04:21.670 --> 04:24.540
<b>I'm starting to wonder if I've just lost my mind.</b>

04:31.380 --> 04:34.830
<b>Naotsugu-sama. Try and lighten up, okay?</b>

04:35.540 --> 04:38.000
<b>Look, your soba is gonna get cold!</b>

04:40.080 --> 04:41.790
<b>Um, Miura-sama?</b>

04:41.960 --> 04:45.630
<b>Sorry if I'm overstepping my bounds here,
but shall I introduce you to a good man for the job?</b>

04:46.040 --> 04:47.460
<b>You know someone?</b>

04:47.880 --> 04:53.040
<b>Yes. I think he might be able
to help with your predicament.</b>

04:54.460 --> 04:55.460
<b>Oh, that's right!</b>

04:55.830 --> 05:01.170
<b>Actually, one of our regulars is a fella who loves
poking his nose into all sorts of freaky stuff.</b>

05:02.580 --> 05:06.290
<b>You mean to say, he's some sort of diviner or shaman?</b>

05:06.710 --> 05:07.290
<b>Huh?</b>

05:08.000 --> 05:11.000
<b>People who make their living by exorcising evil spirits.</b>

05:16.830 --> 05:19.380
<b>Nah, he's just a ronin!</b>

05:19.460 --> 05:23.750
<b>But for some reason, he goes around
resolving strange incidents and mysteries.</b>

05:23.750 --> 05:25.580
<b>For a price, of course.</b>

05:26.040 --> 05:29.630
<b>And I hear he's got sword skills
that can slice a demon to ribbons!</b>

05:30.210 --> 05:31.000
<b>Wow.</b>

05:31.460 --> 05:35.040
<b>He may come off as intimidating, but he's a kind man.</b>

05:35.500 --> 05:37.790
<b>Not to mention he has some funny quirks.</b>

05:38.210 --> 05:41.170
<b>He stops by every day to stuff his face
with our kake-soba.</b>

05:41.670 --> 05:44.080
<b>Oh, speak of the devil!</b>

05:45.540 --> 05:46.750
<b>Welcome in, pal!</b>

05:46.750 --> 05:47.960
<b>Welcome in.</b>

05:48.420 --> 05:49.500
<b>Kake-soba, please.</b>

05:49.630 --> 05:50.420
<b>Comin' up!</b>

05:50.420 --> 05:51.630
<b>One order of kake-soba!</b>

06:08.750 --> 06:12.040
<b>You're just hooked on our kake-soba, aren'tcha, pal?</b>

06:12.380 --> 06:13.920
<b>No, not really.</b>

06:14.210 --> 06:16.210
<b>There you go again.</b>

06:16.210 --> 06:18.710
<b>Would it kill ya to have a little more tact?</b>

06:19.420 --> 06:20.290
<b>Okay.</b>

06:20.880 --> 06:24.580
<b>The soba here may be plain,
but I've developed a soft spot for it.</b>

06:25.380 --> 06:26.380
<b>Now you're talkin'.</b>

06:29.500 --> 06:30.750
<b>Let me pour you some tea.</b>

06:32.420 --> 06:34.080
<b>You've gotten quite good at that.</b>

06:34.420 --> 06:38.380
<b>I should hope so.
I've been working to improve a little each day.</b>

06:39.000 --> 06:41.040
<b>And what progress have you made, Jinya-kun?</b>

06:44.710 --> 06:46.380
<b>Fall is the season for sweet osmanthus.</b>

06:47.130 --> 06:49.750
<b>It exudes a very pleasant fragrance,</b>

06:49.750 --> 06:52.540
<b>and starts to bloom beautiful flowers
around this time of year.</b>

06:53.130 --> 06:54.920
<b>Yes, that's right!</b>

06:55.790 --> 06:58.290
<b>Plants are pretty fascinating to learn about.</b>

06:58.920 --> 07:01.380
<b>My eyes are drawn to all the flowers
on the roadside now.</b>

07:01.580 --> 07:02.670
<b>See, I told you!</b>

07:03.420 --> 07:06.880
<b>Well, now that we've covered
all the different seasonal blooms,</b>

07:07.250 --> 07:10.250
<b>I'll teach you about flowers in mythology next.</b>

07:10.250 --> 07:12.040
<b>Sorry to interrupt your conversation.</b>

07:17.170 --> 07:19.290
<b>Um, if I may...</b>

07:19.830 --> 07:22.170
<b>My name is Naotsugu Miura.</b>

07:22.330 --> 07:24.790
<b>Sorry, I realize this may come off as rude,</b>

07:24.790 --> 07:30.170
<b>but I understand you are a man who occupies himself
with rumors of demons and other strange phenomenon.</b>

07:30.170 --> 07:31.710
<b>Or so I've heard.</b>

07:32.500 --> 07:33.380
<b>Indeed.</b>

07:33.830 --> 07:36.040
<b>Slaying demons is my livelihood.</b>

07:36.500 --> 07:40.580
<b>Great! Then I bet you can get
to the bottom of a mystery for me, yes?</b>

07:41.040 --> 07:42.460
<b>Not necessarily.</b>

07:42.580 --> 07:43.330
<b>Huh?</b>

07:43.580 --> 07:46.500
<b>My expertise is limited to slaying demons.</b>

07:46.960 --> 07:51.130
<b>I'm afraid I won't be of much help unless demons
are the cause of your problem.</b>

07:52.000 --> 07:52.880
<b>Sorry.</b>

07:53.790 --> 07:55.080
<b>Oh, I see...</b>

07:57.880 --> 07:59.170
<b>Miura-sama!</b>

08:17.380 --> 08:22.250
<b>Hey, pal. I hate to ask, but couldja find it
in your heart to lend Naotsugu-sama a hand?</b>

08:23.710 --> 08:29.710
<b>His dummy of a big brother apparently went missing
and now he's worried sick about him, ya see.</b>

08:29.880 --> 08:31.540
<b>Please consider it.</b>

08:32.080 --> 08:36.540
<b>I think losing someone so important
has made him very emotionally unstable.</b>

08:39.920 --> 08:41.130
<b>Pretty please!</b>

08:43.210 --> 08:46.880
<b>All right. I suppose I do owe you two a favor.</b>

08:49.080 --> 08:51.130
<b>You seem rather obsessed with this guy.</b>

08:53.460 --> 08:56.080
<b>Well, yeah, he's one of our few regulars.</b>

09:02.630 --> 09:04.830
<b>DANGO</b>

09:02.630 --> 09:04.830
<b>AMAZAKE</b>

09:02.630 --> 09:04.830
<b>TEA</b>

09:03.080 --> 09:04.830
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

09:10.290 --> 09:14.040
<b>Excuse me! May I have an order of tea and isobe mochi?</b>

09:14.040 --> 09:15.080
<b>Coming up!</b>

09:22.710 --> 09:24.250
<b>You like mochi?</b>

09:27.630 --> 09:28.290
<b>Yep.</b>

09:28.960 --> 09:29.710
<b>Huh.</b>

09:30.830 --> 09:32.210
<b>Here is your order.</b>

09:32.210 --> 09:33.210
<b>Thank you.</b>

09:36.790 --> 09:40.540
<b>Yum. This tastes even better
when you haven't had it in a while.</b>

09:40.960 --> 09:44.330
<b>On a related note,
when are you and Zenji getting married?</b>

09:48.670 --> 09:49.920
<b>Where did that come from?!</b>

09:50.170 --> 09:53.170
<b>You've turned 16 now. That's marrying age.</b>

09:53.460 --> 09:56.960
<b>Okay, but you're crazy if you think I'd marry Zenji.</b>

09:57.170 --> 09:58.130
<b>Is that so?</b>

09:58.630 --> 10:02.250
<b>I imagine Jyuuzou-dono would feel more at ease
seeing you married to someone like him.</b>

10:03.670 --> 10:09.420
<b>But Zenji is... you know, more of a brother figure.</b>

10:10.460 --> 10:14.080
<b>Besides, even though my dad has
his own ideas for prospective husbands,</b>

10:14.380 --> 10:18.130
<b>he's already told me I'm free to choose for myself.</b>

10:18.580 --> 10:23.540
<b>Granted, from a business perspective, I'm sure
he wants me to marry into a samurai or merchant family.</b>

10:26.250 --> 10:28.920
<b>What about you? Don't you want a wife?</b>

10:29.540 --> 10:33.500
<b>Not many women are eccentric enough
to wed a ronin without a steady job.</b>

10:33.920 --> 10:34.790
<b>Oh?</b>

10:36.710 --> 10:38.000
<b>I suppose that's true.</b>

10:40.380 --> 10:44.130
<b>But there comes a time when you
seriously have to consider settling down.</b>

10:44.460 --> 10:46.000
<b>How old are you, anyways?</b>

10:46.580 --> 10:47.750
<b>Thirty one.</b>

10:47.750 --> 10:50.080
<b>No way! You're older than Zenji?!</b>

10:51.330 --> 10:56.080
<b>You joked about being "immune" to getting old...
but, like, what's the actual secret?</b>

10:56.500 --> 10:57.330
<b>Who knows?</b>

10:57.790 --> 10:59.380
<b>I'm putting the money for my bill here!</b>

10:59.880 --> 11:01.130
<b>You're leaving?</b>

11:01.420 --> 11:02.290
<b>Duty calls.</b>

11:02.880 --> 11:04.380
<b>Demons again?</b>

11:08.630 --> 11:12.580
<b>Say, why do you go around hunting demons?</b>

11:12.880 --> 11:17.460
<b>With good swordsmanship like yours,
you should be able to find a number of other jobs, no?</b>

11:19.630 --> 11:21.250
<b>I wish I had an answer.</b>

11:21.960 --> 11:24.040
<b>I'm not sure why I'm doing it, myself.</b>

11:24.500 --> 11:26.000
<b>How does that work?</b>

11:26.790 --> 11:28.420
<b>But if I had to give a reason...</b>

11:29.790 --> 11:32.580
<b>it's because this is the only path for me.</b>

11:33.750 --> 11:34.540
<b>I see.</b>

11:35.040 --> 11:37.040
<b>Well, that's kind of a relief to hear.</b>

11:37.460 --> 11:38.040
<b>Hm?</b>

11:40.040 --> 11:45.250
<b>You have such a dry personality that it sometimes
feels like you don't care about anything in life.</b>

11:45.460 --> 11:48.210
<b>Honestly, I never knew what to think of you.</b>

11:48.790 --> 11:52.250
<b>But now, I see that even you can be a whiny worrywart.</b>

11:53.000 --> 11:55.130
<b>So you're just another regular guy.</b>

11:58.830 --> 11:59.960
<b>Natsu-dono...</b>

11:59.960 --> 12:01.500
<b>Call me Natsu.</b>

12:01.790 --> 12:06.830
<b>We've known each other long enough now.
Being so formal all the time just makes things awkward.</b>

12:08.630 --> 12:11.040
<b>Guess I better get back to the shop.</b>

12:14.210 --> 12:16.250
<b>Don't spend too much time brooding, okay?</b>

12:16.830 --> 12:19.040
<b>You'll end up with permanent wrinkles on your forehead.</b>

12:29.580 --> 12:30.630
<b>Arimori.</b>

12:31.420 --> 12:33.330
<b>You're going looking again?</b>

12:37.130 --> 12:38.880
<b>How many times must I tell you?</b>

12:39.080 --> 12:42.580
<b>You are the only heir to the Miura family.
You have no older brother.</b>

12:42.670 --> 12:44.500
<b>Except I clearly remember him!</b>

12:44.630 --> 12:49.790
<b>I hear that you've been going as far as the slums and the
red-light district in search of this brother. Is that right?</b>

12:51.630 --> 12:56.670
<b>Abide by morals, exemplify courage,
practice compassion, and behave with courtesy.</b>

12:56.670 --> 13:01.710
<b>The samurai code dictates that we give literally
everything in service to our sworn lord, Tokugawa.</b>

13:02.080 --> 13:04.710
<b>And yet you don't seem to care about that in the least.</b>

13:04.710 --> 13:08.380
<b>I'll focus up on my duties
once I find my brother! Now excuse me.</b>

13:09.080 --> 13:11.500
<b>Enough of this already! Arimori!</b>

13:30.040 --> 13:31.080
<b>Hey, Arimori.</b>

13:38.130 --> 13:39.960
<b>Homes aren't what make people.</b>

13:40.330 --> 13:42.210
<b>It's the people who make the home.</b>

13:43.040 --> 13:43.750
<b>Uh-huh...</b>

13:44.250 --> 13:48.000
<b>"For home and country." I can understand that sentiment.</b>

13:49.040 --> 13:53.670
<b>But even so, I'm not willing to twist my values
and beliefs just to abide by it.</b>

13:58.670 --> 14:01.290
<b>Where are you, my brother?</b>

14:03.080 --> 14:04.580
<b>Off to look for him?</b>

14:06.290 --> 14:07.170
<b>It's you!</b>

14:07.670 --> 14:10.330
<b>Jinya. Lowly ronin at your service.</b>

14:10.880 --> 14:14.750
<b>In regards to your mystery,
I have decided to do some digging into it after all.</b>

14:15.040 --> 14:15.630
<b>Huh?</b>

14:16.040 --> 14:21.250
<b>However, I can't promise that I will get any answers.
I hope you understand.</b>

14:22.080 --> 14:23.830
<b>Sure! That's fine.</b>

14:24.250 --> 14:26.290
<b>I'm happy to know you believe me.</b>

14:26.710 --> 14:28.710
<b>That alone is enough to give me peace of mind.</b>

14:29.830 --> 14:32.540
<b>Now then, I'm sorry to cut to the chase,</b>

14:32.540 --> 14:35.750
<b>but I'd like to know how things
were before your brother disappeared.</b>

14:36.250 --> 14:38.380
<b>All right. Then come to my-</b>

14:42.710 --> 14:43.460
<b>In that case...</b>

14:48.040 --> 14:51.790
<b>You introduced yourself as a ronin, earlier, didn't you?</b>

14:52.580 --> 14:53.170
<b>Yes.</b>

14:53.920 --> 14:56.960
<b>I can't help but notice the katana
you carry is of rather high quality.</b>

14:57.460 --> 14:59.460
<b>Do you come from a samurai background?</b>

14:59.790 --> 15:01.380
<b>No, not at all.</b>

15:01.880 --> 15:02.460
<b>Oh?</b>

15:03.040 --> 15:07.750
<b>I once lived in a mountain village filled with bellows
that were used by blacksmiths to forge katana,</b>

15:08.250 --> 15:10.290
<b>and I served in a role that required me to wield one.</b>

15:12.920 --> 15:14.960
<b>Now I'm serving that role once again,</b>

15:15.250 --> 15:18.330
<b>and have gotten direct permission
from the shogunate to carry this blade.</b>

15:19.170 --> 15:20.130
<b>I see.</b>

15:21.000 --> 15:23.380
<b>Are you from Kadono, per chance?</b>

15:24.210 --> 15:25.460
<b>An impressive deduction.</b>

15:26.000 --> 15:31.130
<b>Well, hearing about blacksmiths and bellows,
plus seeing that iron scabbard gave me an inkling.</b>

15:32.080 --> 15:34.710
<b>It's embarrassing to admit,
but I'm somewhat of a connoisseur.</b>

15:34.790 --> 15:37.710
<b>Learning about the different makes of blades
is a pastime of mine.</b>

15:38.290 --> 15:42.790
<b>I've heard one trademark of Kadono blades
is the simple yet refined metalwork on the scabbards.</b>

15:42.960 --> 15:46.130
<b>And the quality of your scabbard is outstanding.</b>

15:46.670 --> 15:51.290
<b>This was originally a sacred blade
that had been enshrined in the village.</b>

15:51.960 --> 15:53.580
<b>But circumstances led it into my hands.</b>

15:53.580 --> 15:55.460
<b>Oh? Does it have a name?</b>

15:55.960 --> 15:56.880
<b>It's called Yarai.</b>

15:57.380 --> 16:00.670
<b>Yarai, eh? Well, that's very interesting!</b>

16:00.920 --> 16:03.420
<b>The blades of Kadono are said
to be effective against demons.</b>

16:03.670 --> 16:07.210
<b>One term for cleansing evil spirits is "oni-yarai,"
which may have inspired the name.</b>

16:07.330 --> 16:11.670
<b>Or perhaps that katana was once used
to exorcise a demonic spirit in a local legend.</b>

16:11.880 --> 16:13.540
<b>Do you know of any such stories?</b>

16:13.750 --> 16:15.420
<b>I can't say that I have.</b>

16:15.630 --> 16:17.000
<b>Nobody knows if it's true,</b>

16:17.000 --> 16:22.040
<b>but the village chieftain said this is a mystical katana
that's remained pristine for over a century.</b>

16:22.130 --> 16:23.420
<b>How fascinating.</b>

16:23.710 --> 16:25.670
<b>Is there any chance you could unsheathe it for me?</b>

16:25.670 --> 16:26.130
<b>No.</b>

16:27.670 --> 16:30.540
<b>My apologies. I've gotten a little too fanatical.</b>

16:30.880 --> 16:31.580
<b>I don't mind.</b>

16:32.000 --> 16:34.040
<b>But we really should get started.</b>

16:35.040 --> 16:35.710
<b>Of course.</b>

16:36.710 --> 16:41.540
<b>As I've already explained, my brother,
Sadanaga Miura, has gone missing.</b>

16:42.210 --> 16:44.960
<b>But I can't find him no matter how much I search.</b>

16:45.080 --> 16:47.880
<b>Worse yet, nobody seems to remember who he is.</b>

16:48.080 --> 16:49.330
<b>No one at all?</b>

16:49.880 --> 16:54.330
<b>No. My parents claim they've never
heard of this "Sadanaga" person.</b>

16:54.330 --> 16:56.210
<b>And that I'm the only heir of the family.</b>

16:56.670 --> 16:59.880
<b>Furthermore, although some people
seemed to have vague memories,</b>

17:00.170 --> 17:02.580
<b>they ultimately just told me the same thing.</b>

17:03.630 --> 17:07.290
<b>I'm forced to conclude that nobody
actually remembers my brother except for me.</b>

17:08.040 --> 17:09.750
<b>Begging your pardon, gentlemen.</b>

17:10.040 --> 17:13.080
<b>But if you're gonna talk about serious business like this,</b>

17:13.080 --> 17:17.830
<b>I think it's common sense to do it in a private place
where there are no people around.</b>

17:18.130 --> 17:20.500
<b>Good thing hardly anybody comes to this shop.</b>

17:21.130 --> 17:23.330
<b>Your tongue's sharper than your sword, eh, pal?</b>

17:24.040 --> 17:29.420
<b>Joking aside, I got the impression that
the two of you were quite concerned for Miura-dono.</b>

17:31.290 --> 17:32.960
<b>Hence why I brought him here.</b>

17:36.630 --> 17:41.040
<b>Nothing, I'm just tickled pink that you've
lightened up enough to start telling jokes.</b>

17:43.040 --> 17:44.000
<b>Whatever.</b>

17:44.460 --> 17:47.290
<b>When exactly did your brother disappear, Miura-dono?</b>

17:47.630 --> 17:50.920
<b>Just before spring started, at the tail end of January.</b>

17:51.420 --> 17:55.500
<b>Nothing seemed out of the ordinary
at that point, until he suddenly...</b>

17:55.960 --> 17:57.000
<b>No, hold on.</b>

17:57.710 --> 18:00.710
<b>I recall him saying something not long before that,</b>

18:01.330 --> 18:03.670
<b>about "going to see a girl."</b>

18:05.750 --> 18:09.000
<b>And one more thing, I found some flowers in his room.</b>

18:09.380 --> 18:10.040
<b>Flowers?</b>

18:10.500 --> 18:15.290
<b>I'm afraid I don't know enough about plants to say
what kind, but they had a strong fragrance.</b>

18:15.790 --> 18:21.040
<b>The leaves were narrow and the flowers
were small with white petals and a yellow center.</b>

18:21.420 --> 18:25.500
<b>My brother wasn't really the type
to appreciate flowers, so I thought it was strange.</b>

18:26.380 --> 18:28.130
<b>When exactly did you find them?</b>

18:28.710 --> 18:30.460
<b>Right after my brother disappeared.</b>

18:30.750 --> 18:36.000
<b>No one else visited his room except for me,
so I imagine it was my brother who left them there.</b>

18:36.420 --> 18:38.540
<b>Do you still have the flowers?</b>

18:38.830 --> 18:42.500
<b>I figured they might serve as evidence,
so I made sure to preserve them before they wilted.</b>

18:44.500 --> 18:45.540
<b>Miura-dono.</b>

18:46.250 --> 18:49.710
<b>I know it may be problematic, but I would like
to pay a visit to your house tomorrow.</b>

18:50.080 --> 18:50.710
<b>Huh?</b>

19:02.420 --> 19:03.960
<b>Oh, hey, Jinya.</b>

19:04.170 --> 19:04.880
<b>Natsu-do...</b>

19:06.750 --> 19:07.460
<b>Natsu.</b>

19:09.000 --> 19:10.920
<b>Welcome in, Jinya-kun.</b>

19:11.210 --> 19:12.000
<b>Kake-soba, please.</b>

19:12.250 --> 19:14.290
<b>Sure. One order of kake-soba!</b>

19:14.290 --> 19:17.830
<b>Say, pal, when did you start
calling Natsu-chan by her name?</b>

19:18.040 --> 19:20.330
<b>Oh. A few days ago, at her request.</b>

19:20.710 --> 19:23.750
<b>Ofuu. You gotta step it up a little more, ya hear?</b>

19:23.750 --> 19:25.750
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

19:26.250 --> 19:28.830
<b>But I must say, you two seem to get along well.</b>

19:28.920 --> 19:31.630
<b>Not really. It's nothing special.</b>

19:31.630 --> 19:34.130
<b>Ofuu, how close are you with Miura-dono?</b>

19:34.630 --> 19:36.630
<b>With Miura-sama?</b>

19:36.880 --> 19:42.380
<b>We aren't especially close or anything,
but we do talk on occasion when he visits the shop.</b>

19:42.920 --> 19:44.000
<b>Why do you ask?</b>

19:44.710 --> 19:46.210
<b>I was just curious.</b>

19:46.880 --> 19:48.460
<b>I see.</b>

19:48.670 --> 19:52.000
<b>Well, he's always been polite in our interactions.</b>

19:52.290 --> 19:54.420
<b>I find him to be a kind and earnest gentleman.</b>

19:54.750 --> 19:58.920
<b>Hold on, are you talking about that samurai
who I bumped into the other day?</b>

19:58.920 --> 19:59.670
<b>Yes.</b>

19:59.920 --> 20:02.330
<b>He seemed like a very humble guy.</b>

20:02.500 --> 20:06.130
<b>Sure, but he can get pretty hyperactive
whenever the subject of swords comes up.</b>

20:07.130 --> 20:08.670
<b>Which reminds me!</b>

20:11.500 --> 20:13.580
<b>Take a look at this, pal.</b>

20:13.920 --> 20:15.250
<b>Wow, a kogai?</b>

20:15.580 --> 20:20.830
<b>Well, you know how the Miura family are vassals of the
shogun, so it's necessary they have these kind of tools.</b>

20:20.920 --> 20:25.670
<b>Anyhoo, not that it means much,
but he gave me this kogai meant for samurai.</b>

20:26.040 --> 20:29.790
<b>I swear, everything boils down to swords with him...</b>

20:30.080 --> 20:34.380
<b>Let the guy talk freely and it's either strictly business
or just something about katana.</b>

20:34.630 --> 20:38.710
<b>I've even heard that his mom chews him out,
like "enough is enough, Arimori"!</b>

20:38.710 --> 20:40.630
<b>You've had dealings with his mother?</b>

20:40.790 --> 20:41.460
<b>Huh?</b>

20:41.460 --> 20:44.630
<b>Yeah, but only enough to catch a quick glimpse of her.</b>

20:44.960 --> 20:49.130
<b>She's a real terror, ya know.
Harps on people regularly from what I hear.</b>

20:51.460 --> 20:54.880
<b>With all that said, pal...
Would ya mind taking this kogai off my hands?</b>

20:55.290 --> 20:58.630
<b>But Miura-dono gave that to you as a gift. I can't.</b>

20:58.630 --> 21:03.420
<b>It's fine. There's not much sense in the owner
of a soba shop having samurai gear like this.</b>

21:03.710 --> 21:04.580
<b>Yes, but...</b>

21:04.670 --> 21:07.580
<b>I don't really have a need for it anymore.</b>

21:07.830 --> 21:09.960
<b>So please just take it off my hands.</b>

21:10.210 --> 21:10.960
<b>Okay?</b>

21:16.130 --> 21:18.080
<b>Fine. I'll hold onto it for you.</b>

21:19.170 --> 21:21.670
<b>I appreciate that! Thank you.</b>

21:22.000 --> 21:25.000
<b>I'm sorry. My dad should know better.</b>

21:25.250 --> 21:26.040
<b>Ofuu.</b>

21:26.290 --> 21:27.080
<b>Yes?</b>

21:27.290 --> 21:33.210
<b>The flowers with white petals and a yellow center
that Miura-dono spoke of... are they daffodils?</b>

21:37.420 --> 21:39.000
<b>Although he did say they were small.</b>

21:41.580 --> 21:44.130
<b>I just hope they're anything but daffodils.</b>

21:47.630 --> 21:50.170
<b>This is the garden of happiness.</b>

21:50.960 --> 21:53.920
<b>The warm and sunny place
where I spent my childhood days.</b>

21:54.630 --> 21:55.380
<b>But...</b>

22:04.250 --> 22:07.750
<b>...the way back is long gone now.</b>
